import{_ as n,o as t,c as i,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const p=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 705 | Transcendence Orthodox Definition | Heng Yuan Zhou's Transcendence Standard — Myriad-Rank Symbiosis + Perpetual Construction","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 705 | Transcendence Orthodox Definition | Heng Yuan Zhou's Transcendence Standard — Myriad-Rank Symbiosis + Perpetual Construction","no":705,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Heng Yuan Zhou Standard","Myriad-Rank Symbiosis","Perpetual Construction","Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm"],"related":["01-Anchor Symbiotic Civilization Manifesto","05-Myriad Ranks Advance-Together Basic Program","17-Plane-Sovereign Strong-One Standard"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0705_模块4-超脱的衡元宙标准.md","filePath":"en/0705_模块4-超脱的衡元宙标准.md"}`),o={name:"en/0705_模块4-超脱的衡元宙标准.md"};function s(r,e,l,c,d,u){return t(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-705-transcendence-orthodox-definition-heng-yuan-zhou-s-transcendence-standard-—-myriad-rank-symbiosis-perpetual-construction" tabindex="-1">Entry 705 | Transcendence Orthodox Definition | Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Transcendence Standard — Myriad-Rank Symbiosis + Perpetual Construction <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-705-transcendence-orthodox-definition-heng-yuan-zhou-s-transcendence-standard-—-myriad-rank-symbiosis-perpetual-construction" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 705 | Transcendence Orthodox Definition | Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Transcendence Standard — Myriad-Rank Symbiosis + Perpetual Construction&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 01, 05, 17</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-two-hard-bars-miss-one-and-it-is-not-transcendence" tabindex="-1">Introduction: two hard bars; miss one and it is not transcendence <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-two-hard-bars-miss-one-and-it-is-not-transcendence" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: two hard bars; miss one and it is not transcendence&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The previous four entries have dissected old web-novel pseudo-transcendences one by one: running-away, lying-flat, monopolizing. After dissection, rules must be established — by what standard does Heng Yuan Zhou recognize a person as &quot;truly transcendent&quot;? The answer is only two hard bars: <strong>Myriad-Rank symbiosis + perpetual construction</strong>. These two are not moral slogans, but law-level admission thresholds, written into the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s fundamental law, enforced throughout by Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision.</p><p>The six top-level axioms in this entry converge into operational standards: the anti-predation axiom ensures the &quot;clean source&quot; premise of the two bars; the republican axiom of Myriad Races is directly the first bar&#39;s parent law; the collective-ascension axiom is directly the second bar&#39;s parent law; the causal self-discipline axiom is procedural protection during the two bars&#39; execution; the law-first axiom ensures these two bars themselves are not modified by plot convenience, strong-one privilege, or any &quot;special circumstance.&quot;</p><p>Universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing/layabouts retain a floor basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes may superimpose more higher-level infinity. Everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, so predation naturally loses meaning.</p><h2 id="i-first-bar-myriad-rank-symbiosis" tabindex="-1">I: First Bar: Myriad-Rank Symbiosis <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-first-bar-myriad-rank-symbiosis" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I: First Bar: Myriad-Rank Symbiosis&quot;">​</a></h2><p>&quot;Myriad-Rank symbiosis&quot; as the transcendence admission standard has three operational layers:</p><h3 id="_1-1-source-symbiosis" tabindex="-1">1.1 Source Symbiosis <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-1-source-symbiosis" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.1 Source Symbiosis&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The transcendent one&#39;s entire power must be traceable to lawful inflow from the Myriad-Rank origin two-way cycle, not predation, devouring, or monopolizing. The Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision does &quot;source audit&quot; on every candidate transcendent:</p><ul><li>Internal energy purity must reach 99%+, with no predation residual marks;</li><li>The cultivation path must be taken from the public branches of the 300 origin cultivation systems, or anchor-certified self-created branches;</li><li>Historical records show no active predation, no private hoarding, no cutting off Myriad Ranks&#39; supply.</li></ul><p>Any item failing, however great the power, is only registered as a &quot;high-risk individual,&quot; not entering the transcendence sequence.</p><h3 id="_1-2-relation-symbiosis" tabindex="-1">1.2 Relation Symbiosis <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-2-relation-symbiosis" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.2 Relation Symbiosis&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The transcendent one must maintain an active symbiotic relation with Myriad Ranks, not severing bonds and going alone. Specific indicators:</p><ul><li>His contribution value on the anchor network ranks in the civilization&#39;s top 20%;</li><li>He has served at least in one Myriad-Rank clan as a guidance post, training post, or deliberation post;</li><li>His methods, experience, and law-weaving results are all queryable in the Selfless Dao public library;</li><li>His civilizational-weight panel is open to Myriad-Rank representatives, accepting periodic deliberation.</li></ul><h3 id="_1-3-coverage-symbiosis" tabindex="-1">1.3 Coverage Symbiosis <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-3-coverage-symbiosis" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.3 Coverage Symbiosis&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The transcendent one&#39;s existence must objectively expand Myriad-Rank republicanism&#39;s coverage, not shrink it. A qualified transcendent one&#39;s lifetime activities must satisfy at least one:</p><ul><li>Brought some previously uncovered clan (plant spirits, planet consciousness, cosmic-origin bodies, multiverse-remnant civilizations, etc.) into the anchor network;</li><li>Opened some previously locked civilizational tier (e.g., Tang-Luo-style fierce-realm ceiling);</li><li>Gave some previously pathless special life form an orthodox cultivation system.</li></ul><h2 id="ii-second-bar-perpetual-construction" tabindex="-1">II: Second Bar: Perpetual Construction <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-second-bar-perpetual-construction" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II: Second Bar: Perpetual Construction&quot;">​</a></h2><p>&quot;Perpetual construction&quot; as the transcendence admission standard likewise has three operational layers:</p><h3 id="_2-1-post-perpetuity" tabindex="-1">2.1 Post Perpetuity <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-1-post-perpetuity" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.1 Post Perpetuity&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The transcendent one must accept the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm as a <strong>permanent-post realm</strong>, not a temporary cultivation end. He must claim a specific post in the law network — law-network maintenance post, Myriad-Rank evolution guidance post, cross-plane anchor construction post, Alaya Network supervision post, civilization error-correction and historical-reverse prevention post, incremental-development and resource-creation post, Myriad-Rank-republicanism deliberation-coordination post, new-universe opening and law-weaving post, transcendent-one training and transmission post (see Entries 711–720).</p><p>A post is not nominal, but a contract. At least 30% of time and energy annually go to post work (following Document 17&#39;s strong-one duty system), and post performance enters civilizational weight.</p><h3 id="_2-2-increment-perpetuity" tabindex="-1">2.2 Increment Perpetuity <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-2-increment-perpetuity" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.2 Increment Perpetuity&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The transcendent one&#39;s lifetime output must be <strong>civilization increment</strong>, not stock consumption. Judgment criteria:</p><ul><li>Do the new methods, new law-weaving schemes, and new civilizational engineering he created increase the Myriad-Rank origin two-way cycle&#39;s total flow?</li><li>Do the anchors, planes, and ecosystems he maintains make previously unstable systems more stable?</li><li>Do the latecomers he cultivates start higher and go farther than he himself did?</li></ul><p>If any one of the three questions is no, the transcendent one is at that stage in &quot;stock consumption&quot; state, and the Alaya Network automatically triggers a reminder, requiring him to adjust direction.</p><h3 id="_2-3-iteration-perpetuity" tabindex="-1">2.3 Iteration Perpetuity <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-3-iteration-perpetuity" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.3 Iteration Perpetuity&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The transcendent one himself may not stop iterating. In Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s law definition, &quot;a transcendent one who stops iterating&quot; is a self-contradictory concept — because law itself is expanding infinitely, and if you do not follow law, you are left behind by law. This is not cruel; this is the law-first axiom&#39;s natural corollary: <strong>the worldview may expand infinitely without collapse, meaning the transcendent one&#39;s post content must also expand infinitely.</strong></p><h2 id="iii-the-two-bars-synergy-myriad-rank-symbiosis-defines-direction-perpetual-construction-defines-intensity" tabindex="-1">III: The Two Bars&#39; Synergy: Myriad-Rank Symbiosis Defines Direction, Perpetual Construction Defines Intensity <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-the-two-bars-synergy-myriad-rank-symbiosis-defines-direction-perpetual-construction-defines-intensity" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III: The Two Bars&#39; Synergy: Myriad-Rank Symbiosis Defines Direction, Perpetual Construction Defines Intensity&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The two bars are not parallel, but a <strong>direction and intensity</strong> relation:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th></th><th>Myriad-Rank Symbiosis (direction)</th><th>Perpetual Construction (intensity)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Defines what</td><td>Whom power serves, to whom the Dao is open</td><td>How much power outputs, how fast the Dao iterates</td></tr><tr><td>Noncompliance manifests as</td><td>Running away, monopolizing, predation</td><td>Lying flat, idling, slumbering</td></tr><tr><td>Alaya Network judgment</td><td>Ethical review fails</td><td>Post performance substandard</td></tr><tr><td>Disposition</td><td>Does not enter transcendence sequence</td><td>Triggers post replacement</td></tr></tbody></table><p>A person may have immense power but wrong direction (predation-faction strong one), or right direction but insufficient intensity (retirement-style elder). Only pressing both bars simultaneously can leave the &quot;true transcendence&quot; position to those <strong>with right direction, sufficient intensity, clean source, broad coverage</strong>.</p><h2 id="iv-connection-with-the-plane-sovereign-strong-one-four-dimensional-assessment" tabindex="-1">IV: Connection with the Plane-Sovereign Strong-One Four-Dimensional Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-connection-with-the-plane-sovereign-strong-one-four-dimensional-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV: Connection with the Plane-Sovereign Strong-One Four-Dimensional Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s standard system is nested:</p><ul><li>Document 17&#39;s plane-sovereign strong-one four-dimensional assessment (power 40 / heart-nature 25 / contribution 20 / responsibility 15) is the <strong>entry assessment</strong>, eligible once Origin Realm is reached;</li><li>This Entry 705&#39;s &quot;Myriad-Rank symbiosis + perpetual construction&quot; two bars is the <strong>transcendence assessment</strong>, entered once the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm is reached;</li><li>The two are directionally consistent, but the transcendence assessment is stricter on contribution and responsibility: not &quot;top-20% level,&quot; but &quot;post perpetuity, increment perpetuity, iteration perpetuity.&quot;</li></ul><p>This nested design ensures: from Sense-Condensed Realm, every realm ascent deepens his binding with Myriad-Rank symbiosis and perpetual construction; by the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm, &quot;Myriad-Rank symbiosis + perpetual construction&quot; is no longer an external assessment, but his life&#39;s own mode of existence.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V: Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V: Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: the two bars direct every bit of strong-one compute into &quot;producing increment for Myriad Ranks,&quot; eliminating any form of energy idling</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: source-symbiosis audit cuts off predatory transcendence at the source, not allowing those who &quot;ascend over Myriad Ranks&#39; bones&quot; into the transcendence sequence</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-style transcendence&#39;s standard is &quot;is the protagonist strong enough&quot;; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s standard is &quot;how much increment did the protagonist produce for Myriad Ranks&quot; — the former looks at the individual, the latter at the network</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the coverage-symbiosis clause explicitly lists plant spirits, planet consciousness, cosmic-origin bodies, and multiverse-remnant civilizations as objects the transcendent one must serve</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: the iteration-perpetuity clause requires the transcendent one&#39;s every output be queryable in the Selfless Dao public library, with hyper-multiverse-tier knowledge set with no access threshold</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinity</strong>: the universal equal infinite law — within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization everyone inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing layabouts retain a floor basic infinity and are not eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes may superimpose higher-level infinity; everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, and predation naturally loses meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou recognizes a person as truly transcendent not by how high his combat power, not by how long he has lived, not by how many enemies he has defeated. Only two: whether he symbioses with Myriad Ranks, whether he is in perpetual construction. Right direction, sufficient intensity, clean source, broad coverage — he is a transcendent one. Any one missing, however invincible, however immortal, however lonely, is only pseudo-transcendence. <strong>This is Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s final definition of the two words &quot;transcendence.&quot;</strong></p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/01-锚点共生文明宣言.html">Entry 01 · Anchor Symbiotic Civilization Manifesto</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/05-万族共进基本纲领.html">Entry 05 · Myriad Ranks Advance-Together Basic Program</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/17-位面至高强者标准.html">Entry 17 · Plane-Sovereign Strong-One Standard</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/29-共生度评估体系.html">Entry 29 · Symbiosis-Degree Assessment System</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',43)])])}const m=n(o,[["render",s]]);export{p as __pageData,m as default};
